flowchart LR
    A[Business services] -->|Domain event| K[(Kafka topic)]
    K --> C[Notification event consumer]
    C -->|DB transaction| DB[(Notification DB and outbox)]
    DB --> O[Outbox publisher]
    O -->|Delivery task| Q[(Amazon SQS)]
    Q --> W[Golang delivery workers]
    W -->|Send API| P[External messaging provider]
    P -->|Webhook / receipt| H[Callback API]
    H --> DB
    W -->|Attempt outcome| DB
    Q -->|Redrive policy| DLQ[(Dead-letter queue)]
    DLQ --> R[Operator review and safe replay]
    R --> Q
